       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INSPECTTEST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 T1   PIC X(10) VALUE "AABACAAADA".
       01 T2   PIC X(8)  VALUE "  12 3  ".
       01 CNT  PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       01 CNT2 PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           INSPECT T1 TALLYING CNT FOR ALL "A".
           DISPLAY "CNT=" CNT.
           MOVE 0 TO CNT.
           INSPECT T1 TALLYING CNT FOR LEADING "A".
           DISPLAY "CNT=" CNT.
           MOVE 0 TO CNT.
           INSPECT T1 TALLYING CNT FOR CHARACTERS BEFORE INITIAL "C".
           DISPLAY "CNT=" CNT.
           MOVE 0 TO CNT CNT2.
           INSPECT T1 TALLYING CNT FOR ALL "AA" CNT2 FOR ALL "A".
           DISPLAY "CNT=" CNT " CNT2=" CNT2.
           INSPECT T1 REPLACING ALL "A" BY "X" AFTER INITIAL "C".
           DISPLAY T1.
           MOVE "AABACAAADA" TO T1.
           INSPECT T1 REPLACING LEADING "A" BY "Z".
           DISPLAY T1.
           INSPECT T1 REPLACING FIRST "C" BY "Q".
           DISPLAY T1.
           INSPECT T1 REPLACING CHARACTERS BY "*" BEFORE INITIAL "B".
           DISPLAY T1.
           INSPECT T1 CONVERTING "ABQ" TO "abq".
           DISPLAY T1.
           MOVE 0 TO CNT.
           INSPECT T2 TALLYING CNT FOR LEADING SPACES.
           DISPLAY "CNT=" CNT.
           INSPECT T2 REPLACING ALL SPACES BY ZEROS.
           DISPLAY T2.
           STOP RUN.
